  "question": {
    "text": "The number of common terms in the progressions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo></math>, up to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mtext>th </mtext></msup></math> term and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></math>,.... up to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>37</mn><mtext>th </mtext></msup></math> term is :",
